<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 89.06 mln rand S.Africa bonds Tues.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 89.06 mln rand S.Africa bonds Tues.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 89.06 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Tuesday after selling 38.34 million rands worth on Monday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
